<figure class="branch-map">
	<div class="map-header">
		<span class="eyebrow">The review network</span>
		<strong>Next stop: a tested contribution.</strong>
	</div>
	<ul class="legend" aria-label="Branch lines">
		<li><span class="line main-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><code>main</code></li>
		<li><span class="line feature-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>Feature branch</li>
		<li><span class="line patch-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>Review patch</li>
	</ul>
	<div class="map-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Branch map, scroll horizontally on small screens" tabindex="0">
		<svg viewBox="0 0 1120 440" role="img" aria-labelledby="review-map-title review-map-description">
			<title id="review-map-title">A patch-in PR, drawn as a transit network</title>
			<desc id="review-map-description">
				Time moves left to right. The feature branch leaves main. At the reviewed
				commit, a separate review patch branches off, adds a fix and regression
				test, and runs checks. After human acceptance, the patch merges into the
				feature branch, where combined checks run again. The original PR then
				merges into main after approval. The patch never merges directly into main.
			</desc>
			<g class="tracks" fill="none" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
				<path class="main-track" d="M 50 90 H 1080" />
				<path class="feature-track" d="M 150 90 H 170 Q 190 90 210 110 L 260 160 Q 280 180 310 180 H 900 Q 930 180 950 160 L 1000 110 Q 1020 90 1040 90" />
				<path class="patch-track" d="M 410 180 H 430 Q 450 180 470 200 L 520 250 Q 540 270 570 270 H 730 Q 760 270 780 250 L 830 200 Q 850 180 880 180 H 900" />
			</g>
			<g class="stations" fill="#fff" stroke-width="5">
				<circle class="interchange" cx="150" cy="90" r="10" />
				<circle class="feature-station" cx="330" cy="180" r="8" />
				<circle class="interchange" cx="410" cy="180" r="10" />
				<circle class="patch-station" cx="580" cy="270" r="8" />
				<circle class="patch-station" cx="710" cy="270" r="8" />
				<circle class="interchange" cx="900" cy="180" r="10" />
				<circle class="interchange" cx="1040" cy="90" r="10" />
			</g>
			<g class="labels">
				<text x="150" y="48" text-anchor="middle">Branch off</text>
				<text x="330" y="225" text-anchor="end">Build feature</text>
				<text x="410" y="124" text-anchor="middle">
					<tspan x="410">Reviewed</tspan><tspan x="410" dy="25">commit</tspan>
				</text>
				<text x="580" y="315" text-anchor="middle">
					<tspan x="580">Fix +</tspan><tspan x="580" dy="25">regression test</tspan>
				</text>
				<text x="710" y="225" text-anchor="middle">Run checks</text>
				<text x="900" y="225" text-anchor="middle">
					<tspan x="900">Accept patch</tspan><tspan x="900" dy="25">+ rerun checks</tspan>
				</text>
				<text x="1040" y="32" text-anchor="end">
					<tspan x="1040">Merge original PR</tspan><tspan x="1040" dy="25">after approval</tspan>
				</text>
			</g>
			<g class="route-notes">
				<text x="70" y="390">TIME MOVES LEFT TO RIGHT</text>
				<path d="M 410 383 H 1050 M 1038 375 L 1050 383 L 1038 391" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
			</g>
		</svg>
	</div>
	<figcaption>
		Two PRs, two destinations: the review patch joins the feature branch;
		the original PR carries the combined change to <code>main</code>.
	</figcaption>
</figure>

